  "longBusinessSummary": "UMT United Mobility Technology AG engages in the development and implementation of customized solutions for the digitalization of business processes in Germany. The company offers UMS Vision AI, an AI-based automated document processing and analysis solution; and T4 (Trackability, Traceability, Transparency, and Trust) blockchain solution that enables seamless compliance with the new EU regulations, including the product passport requirements. It also licenses mobile payment platforms and acts as a central interface between various parties, such as retail chains, banks, bonus program providers, and end consumers. In addition, the company offers mobile payment, mobile wallet, loyalty/bonus programs, and data analytics solutions; and consulting and implementation services. It serves the logistics, insurance, and commerce industries. The company was formerly known as Leipziger Solarpark AG and changed its name to UMT United Mobility Technology AG in 2011. UMT United Mobility Technology AG was founded in 1989 and is headquartered in Munich, Germany.",
